OL,3,GNEWSADog who lost both eyes learns to
OL,4,Anavigate by scent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA working cocker spaniel who lost both
OL,7,Feyes to a painful condition has
OL,8,Fundergone a remarkable rehabilitation,
OL,9,Fusing his sense of smell to navigate
OL,10,Fthe world almost like a new pair of
OL,11,Feyes.
OL,13,FHero, from Clevedon in North Somerset,
OL,14,Fbecame blind in July and initially grew
OL,15,Fwithdrawn and anxious, but scent
OL,16,Ftraining has helped him regain
OL,17,Fconfidence and adapt to life without
OL,18,Fsight.
OL,20,FHis owners, Jane Stuart Brown and Rob
OL,21,FGrubb, say they are amazed by how he
OL,22,Fhas coped with the life-changing loss.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
