OL,3,GNEWSADog who lost both eyes learns to
OL,4,Anavigate by scent
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He's a superstar. We're so proud, of
OL,7,Fhow he's accepted this situation and
OL,8,Fhe's just getting on with it," said
OL,9,FStuart Brown.
